    "title": "Penn State women's basketball's Shaelyn Steele enters transfer portal - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Noah Aberegg ,\n1 days ago After being just one of two players to not enter the transfer portal from last year’s Penn State squad, Shaelyn Steele is officially out per Talia Goodman of On3. Steele announced her entrance to the transfer portal on Tuesday, becoming the last of the Lady Lions to depart from Happy Valley after Tanisha Wright was hired. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
